; Part of ferrum. MIT licence, see ferrum/LICENSE.
; One deflection station on a rotary part: o<ferrum_rotary_station> call
; [dia] [dir] [A start]. The probe is above the cylinder at work Y0. A top
; touch at A start sets the clearance height; side touches (ball centre at
; work Z0) from -Y at A start + dir x 90 (y+) and from +Y at A start -
; dir x 90 (y-) give the Y centre; then top touches over that Y centre at A
; start (z0) and A start + 2 x dir x 90 (z180); each radius is checked
; against dia/2. Sets
; #<_ferrum_station_y> = (y+ + y-)/2, #<_ferrum_station_z> = (z0 + z180)/2
; and #<_ferrum_station_clear> (the height A turned at). Ends at that
; height over the Y centre, with A at its start. Needs o<ferrum_rotary_ready> first.
o<ferrum_rotary_station> sub
#<dia> = #1
#<dir> = #2
#<a0> = #3
#<nom> = [#<dia> / 2]
#<r> = [[#5410 / 2] - #3032]
o<ferrum_guarded_move> call [0] [0 - #5421] [0]
o<ferrum_rotary_top> call [#<a0>] [#<dia> + [2 * #3021]]
#<z0> = #<_value>
o<ferrum_rotary_plausible> call [#<z0>] [#<nom>] [0]
#<clear> = [#<z0> + #<dia> + #3021]
#<standoff> = [#<nom> + #3019 + #<r> + [2 * #<_ferrum_mm>]]
#<span> = [#<dia> + [2 * #3019] + [2 * #<r>] + [4 * #<_ferrum_mm>]]
o<ferrum_rotary_side> call [1] [#<a0> + [#<dir> * 90]] [#<standoff>] [#<span>] [#<clear>] [0]
#<yp> = #<_value>
o<ferrum_rotary_plausible> call [ABS[#<yp>]] [#<nom>] [1]
o<ferrum_rotary_side> call [-1] [#<a0> - [#<dir> * 90]] [#<standoff>] [#<span>] [#<clear>] [0]
#<ym> = #<_value>
o<ferrum_rotary_plausible> call [ABS[#<ym>]] [#<nom>] [2]
#<yc> = [[#<yp> + #<ym>] / 2]
; Both top touches over the measured Y centre (the section's highest point).
G90 G1 A#<a0> F#3017
o<ferrum_guarded_move> call [0] [#<yc> - #5421] [0]
o<ferrum_guarded_move> call [0] [0] [#<z0> + #3021 - #5422]
o<ferrum_rotary_top> call [#<a0>] [2 * #3021]
#<z0> = #<_value>
o<ferrum_guarded_move> call [0] [0] [#<clear> - #5422]
o<ferrum_rotary_top> call [#<a0> + [2 * #<dir> * 90]] [#<dia> + [2 * #3021]]
#<z180> = #<_value>
o<ferrum_rotary_plausible> call [#<z180>] [#<nom>] [4]
o<ferrum_guarded_move> call [0] [0] [#<clear> - #5422]
G90 G1 A#<a0> F#3017
#<_ferrum_station_y> = #<yc>
#<_ferrum_station_z> = [[#<z0> + #<z180>] / 2]
#<_ferrum_station_clear> = #<clear>
o<ferrum_rotary_station> endsub
M2
